\cf0 Now we need to create a new entry row, with two pointers for the camera.\par
\pard\sl276\slmult1 The pointers are set with a basic calculation: \par
\cf3 08\cf0  pointer increments by 30 (hex) in each cam entry;\cf3\par
09\cf0  pointer increments by 01 (hex) each time previous pointer passes FF;\par
\cf3 0C \cf0 pointer increments by 52 (dec) in each cam entry;\par
\cf3 0D\cf0  pointer increments by 01 (hex) each time previous pointer passes FF.\par
